::  modules/flare/glow/gate-flare-slice.glow -- context bundle bound
/!  16384
|%
++  gate-flare-slice
  |=  [tokens=@ud max-ctx=@ud]                          ::  prompt token cap
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  clamped slice
  ?>  (lte max-ctx 32768)                               ::  bounded Lantern KV
  ?:  (lte tokens max-ctx)  tokens  max-ctx             ::  never overflow KV
--
